 "text": "A small card for the Freedich Gold Trader. It shows \"Active now\" with the time left until he despawns, or the next spawn with a countdown, in the reader's own time zone. The Gold Trader is up for 2 hours, then gone for 2 hours, on repeat. It links to the World Events page and appears once the script has run. Usage {{GoldTraderNext}} The spawn times and how long he stays are in Module:WorldEventData (the event with panel = true), the same data as the Gold Trader card in Template:Tl. Needs Module:WorldNext, Template:WorldNext/styles.css and the World Events script in MediaWiki:Common.js. To show it next to the other cards on the Main Page, use instead.",
 "html": "<p>A small card for the Freedich Gold Trader. It shows \"Active now\" with the time left until he despawns, or the next spawn with a countdown, in the reader's own time zone. The Gold Trader is up for 2 hours, then gone for 2 hours, on repeat. It links to the World Events page and appears once the script has run.\n</p><p><b>Usage</b>\n</p>\n<pre>{{GoldTraderNext}}</pre>\n<ul><li>The spawn times and how long he stays are in <code>Module:WorldEventData</code> (the event with <code>panel = true</code>), the same data as the Gold Trader card in <a href=\"https://wiki.aa-classic.com/index.php?title=Template:Tl&action=edit&redlink=1\" rel=\"noopener\">Template:Tl</a>.</li>\n<li>Needs <code>Module:WorldNext</code>, <code>Template:WorldNext/styles.css</code> and the World Events script in <code>MediaWiki:Common.js</code>.</li>\n<li>To show it next to the other cards on the Main Page, use <code><div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Leviathan\" src=\"/wiki-files/b0/b07a261986879bf622a52b5d229b0261a25ce39b.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Red Dragon / Kraken / Berserker\" src=\"/wiki-files/b6/b642df113ef40170097f3e11f0e5ecbe9d332150.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Primal Anthalon\" src=\"/wiki-files/cf/cffa8dd89054e701cbd17f385a069027c35c39d3.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Red Dragon / Primal Anthalon\" src=\"/wiki-files/94/942ed910d78c91ea4d66193ecc8a291c70ca1f55.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Red Dragon / Primal Anthalon\" src=\"/wiki-files/cf/cffa8dd89054e701cbd17f385a069027c35c39d3.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Primal Kraken\" src=\"/wiki-files/15/15e88f4122c978cd9d1bd4237473362e4983b534.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Berserker\" src=\"/wiki-files/72/722f42d4915eeb14151a8d085799196569215676.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Kraken\" src=\"/wiki-files/15/15e88f4122c978cd9d1bd4237473362e4983b534.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Mistmerrow\" src=\"/wiki-files/ee/ee49a569e3e30145980f4ac55f7fd748e17a62e6.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Halcyona\" src=\"/wiki-files/51/51c21164dc95437995c4c6b5d9ab52633a3718f0.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Luscas\" src=\"/wiki-files/55/55aca9220eac42769ac1967d648ddb6ef1b5f736.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Delphinad Ghost Ship\" src=\"/wiki-files/ad/ad5065bc299683a008307a59fa4a8cd94a21ca63.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Veroe Harvest Festival\" src=\"/wiki-files/fd/fd5e582488e74f2111f28c27654cd49b64485fd8.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Abyssal Attack\" src=\"/wiki-files/e4/e43b3c26f03ae46e18cbd2087811a34e086b2eec.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Supplying the Settlers\" src=\"/wiki-files/e8/e875e8204359397358e4c63110da2e4dc5ef46af.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Freedich Gold Trader\" src=\"/wiki-files/36/36590c3d60bb519140b7b6e669695c031282ed1a.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Grimghast Rift\" src=\"/wiki-files/cb/cbaea2c1956ee464f75eabc00b37d08a69ab6a80.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Jola/Meina/Glenn\" src=\"/wiki-files/0b/0b1858024fb7abb84e4da97f025542af79e87f62.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Crimson Rift\" src=\"/wiki-files/d9/d97614b4a7c9d667ac589bcd5af4db074df5d117.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Sungold Crimson Rift\" src=\"/wiki-files/d9/d97614b4a7c9d667ac589bcd5af4db074df5d117.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"Hasla Rift\" src=\"/wiki-files/15/15a2e91c34dd4e4ac29c703f362fd4bb4e74d1a1.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></code> instead.</li></ul>",
 "wikitext": "<includeonly><templatestyles src=\"WorldNext/styles.css\" />{{#invoke:WorldNext|main|type=trader}}</includeonly><noinclude>\nA small card for the Freedich Gold Trader. It shows \"Active now\" with the time left until he despawns, or the next spawn with a countdown, in the reader's own time zone. The Gold Trader is up for 2 hours, then gone for 2 hours, on repeat. It links to the World Events page and appears once the script has run.\n\n'''Usage'''\n<pre>{{GoldTraderNext}}</pre>\n\n* The spawn times and how long he stays are in <code>Module:WorldEventData</code> (the event with <code>panel = true</code>), the same data as the Gold Trader card in {{tl|WorldEventTimetable}}.\n* Needs <code>Module:WorldNext</code>, <code>Template:WorldNext/styles.css</code> and the World Events script in <code>MediaWiki:Common.js</code>.\n* To show it next to the other cards on the Main Page, use <code>{{WorldNext|type=boss,daily,game,trader}}</code> instead.\n[[Category:Layout templates]]\n</noinclude>"
